{"hymn":"S716","parent":"E1280","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"En resurrección nos hizo","subtitle":"Las reuniones—En resurrección","syl":{"n1":"En","n2":["re","i"],"n3":["su","m"],"n4":["rrec","m"],"n5":["ción","t"],"n6":"nos","n7":["hi","i"],"n8":["zo","t"],"n9":"Sus","n10":["her","i"],"n11":["ma","m"],"n12":["nos,","t"],"n13":"el","n14":["Se","i"],"n15":["ñor;","t"],"n16":["¡Quie","i"],"n17":["re","t"],"n18":"Él","n19":"que","n20":"Sus","n21":["her","i"],"n22":["ma","m"],"n23":["nos,","t"],"n25":"De","n26":"Su","n27":["triun","i"],"n28":["fo","t"],"n29":["go","i"],"n30":["cen","t"],"n31":"hoy!","n32":["Jes","i"],"n33":["cris","m"],"n34":["to‿es","t"],"n35":["nu","i"],"n36":["es","m"],"n37":["tro‿Her","m"],"n38":["ma","m"],"n39":["no,","t"],"n40":["Pri","i"],"n41":["mo","m"],"n42":["gé","m"],"n43":["ni","m"],"n44":["to","t"],"n45":"de","n46":"Dios;","n47":["¡Li","i"],"n48":["bre","t"],"n49":"de","n50":"la","n51":["re","i"],"n52":["li","m"],"n53":["gión!","t"],"n54":"Él","n55":"En","n56":["re","i"],"n57":["su","m"],"n58":["rrec","m"],"n59":["ción","t"],"n60":["na","i"],"n61":["ció.","t"],"n62":["Co","i"],"n63":["mo‿i","m"],"n64":["gle","m"],"n65":["sia","t"],"n66":"nos","n67":["reu","i"],"n68":["ni","m"],"n69":["mos","t"],"n70":"Sin","n71":["ve","i"],"n72":["jez,","t"],"n73":["ri","i"],"n74":["tual","t"],"n75":"o‿el","n76":"yo;","n77":["Pa","i"],"n78":["ra","t"],"n79":["dar","i"],"n80":["le‿a","t"],"n81":["nues","i"],"n82":["tro‿her","m"],"n83":["ma","m"],"n84":["no","t"],"n85":["A","i"],"n86":["la","m"],"n87":["ban","m"],"n88":["zas","t"],"n89":"y","n90":["ho","i"],"n91":["nor.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["En resurrección, reunidos","Con el hermano mayor,","No en lo natural confiamos;","Esto alegra al Señor."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Cada día en la Palabra,","A Jesús debemos ver;","Vamos luego a las reuniones,","Rebosando así con Él."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["¡Qué banquete, las reuniones!","Hay comida sin cesar,","Y Jesús nos satisface,","Dándonos viviente pan."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Nuestro Hermano aún disfruta","Nuestra pequeña porción;","Cada cual su \"nuevo plato\"","Debe dar en comunión."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["No buscamos los mensajes,","Sino estar con el Señor;","Nos importa la presencia","De nuestro Hermano mayor."]}]}